        "c": {
          "type": "literal",
          "value": "Santosh Kumar Gulwadi was an Indian journalist and novelist. He has written 7 books including story compilations in Kannada. He was an editor in newspaper Prajavani, magazine Sudha, Vijay Sankeshwar's magazine Noothana and the first chief-editor of magazine Taranga, from 1982 to 1999.",
